    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_02",
      "hash64": "7B3D7CADF77F0C43",
      "text": "The Treasure Hunt—it’s finally starting![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0305_select_01",
      "hash64": "2D36583380FB23AA",
      "text": "What do they mean by treasure?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0305_select_02",
      "hash64": "2D36573380FB21F7",
      "text": "What’re we supposed to do?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_03",
      "hash64": "7B3D7BADF77F0A90",
      "text": "Yeah, fair question, since it’s your first time!\\nC’mon, let’s walk and talk...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_04a",
      "hash64": "E89B219B8CF283FC",
      "text": "The Treasure Hunt is a huge part of the Naranja\\nAcademy school year.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_04b",
      "hash64": "E89B249B8CF28915",
      "text": "The Treasure Hunt is a huge part of the Uva\\nAcademy school year.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_05",
      "hash64": "7B3D81ADF77F14C2",
      "text": "The point isn’t to get us all looking for some\\nactual hidden treasure, necessarily...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_06",
      "hash64": "7B3D80ADF77F130F",
      "text": "We’re more just making our own adventures to\\nsee what experiences Paldea’s got to offer![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_07",
      "hash64": "7B3D7FADF77F115C",
      "text": "You could try to beat Pokémon Gyms, you could\\nhelp out people in need... You could hunt for\\r\\nreal capital-T treasure if you wanted, even![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_08",
      "hash64": "7B3D86ADF77F1D41",
      "text": "There’s stuff we’d never learn sitting in a\\nclassroom, y’know? This is our chance to learn it![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_09",
      "hash64": "7B3D85ADF77F1B8E",
      "text": "Plus there’s so many chances to battle, which is\\nobviously perfect for me![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0305_rival_10",
      "hash64": "7B39F8ADF77BF620",
      "text": "You and me for sure gotta battle if we run into\\neach other out there! Hope you’re ready![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
